fication_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Inspect the JSON response for `verified == 'true'`. If true, set `variables.identity_verified = 'true'`.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.account_locked == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 3,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Generate a temporary password for the locked user.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_reasoning\": \"Gate 1-4 passed: The SOP explicitly describes generating a temporary password for the locked user, which matches the `generate_temporary_password` function in the Solandra platform. The platform is active, the function aligns with the problem, and all required inputs (`user_id`) are available. This step is classified as a `tool_call` because it directly maps to the `generate_temporary_password` function.\",\n            \"platform\": \"solandra\",\n            \"function_name\": \"generate_temporary_password\",\n            \"comm_inputs\": {\n                \"user_id\": \"{{{{variables.user_id}}}}\"\n            },\n            \"command\": null,\n            \"shell\": null,\n            \"fallback_command\": null,\n            \"fallback_sop_id\": null,\n            \"expected_output_contains\": \"temporary_password\",\n            \"timeout_seconds\": 30,\n            \"output_variable\": \"password_generation_result\",\n            \"output_parse_instruction\": \"Inspect the JSON response for `temporary_password`. Store the generated password in `variables.temporary_password`.\",\n            \"execute_if\": \"variables.identity_verified == 'true'\",\n            \"is_dangerous\": false,\n            \"danger_warning\": null\n        },\n        {\n            \"step_number\": 4,\n            \"sop_step_description\": \"Resolve the ticket with an audit note.\",\n            \"step_type\": \"tool_call\",\n            \"step_r